# Single-page-application fallback for Cloudflare Pages.
#
# The archive uses clean URLs — /history/…, /leboku/2026, /language — so that a
# link shared on WhatsApp or printed as a QR code resolves directly, and so
# search engines can index each section at its own address.
#
# Without this rule, requesting any path other than / would return a 404: those
# paths exist only inside the Flutter router, not as files on disk. The 200
# status (rather than a redirect) is what preserves the URL in the address bar.
/*    /index.html   200
